      "message": "I\u0027d like to keep the hardcoded values. The MPU SRAM region has to cover the whole 256K starting at 0x20000000, including retain_mem. realtekfp.dts overrides sram0 to \u003c0x20000400 DT_SIZE_K(255)\u003e to leave the first 1K for retain_mem, so taking the base and size from sram0 would leave that part outside the MPU region. I added a comment above REGION_SRAM_BASE to explain this.",
